  "text": "### 3. Compliance & Regulatory Risk  \n**Appetite:** Minimal/Zero  \n**Tolerance:**\n- **Regulatory Breaches:** Zero willful violations\n- **KYC/AML Non-Compliance:** 0% tolerance\n- **Customer Protection Breaches:** 0% tolerance\n- **Disclosure Violations:** Zero  \n**Rationale:**\nFirstUK Bank operates under close regulatory oversight. Any regulatory breach damages reputation and license. Invests heavily in compliance infrastructure.  \n**Controls:**\n- Compliance policies and procedures (see Policies)\n- Regular regulatory scanning and updates\n- Staff training (mandatory annual)\n- Audit testing of compliance controls\n- Regulatory relationship management  \n---",
